{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14214430","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14214430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1421443001:1":{"text":"大约受到沙利叶一路而来经历的触动，因度厄看起来有些心事重重。","source_cn":"大约受到沙利叶一路而来经历的触动，因度厄看起来有些心事重重。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0156BBD32162D0B8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"大约受到沙利叶一路而来经历的触动，因度厄看起来有些心事重重。","female":"大约受到沙利叶一路而来经历的触动，因度厄看起来有些心事重重。","variant_male_record_index":"162751","variant_female_record_index":"162752","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421443002:1":{"text":"怎么了？一副苦大仇深的表情，你该不会把我刚刚的玩笑话当真了吧？","source_cn":"怎么了？一副苦大仇深的表情，你该不会把我刚刚的玩笑话当...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18DAA5036B6B3934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421443003:0":{"text":"不，我知道你是在开玩笑。但我也认真地在想，我是不是真的不适合做一个领导者。","source_cn":"不，我知道你是在开玩笑。但我也认真地在想，我是不是真的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7BEC6A6CB00D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421443004:1":{"text":"还在做追捕工作的时候，我以为我已经很了解那些勾心斗角的阴暗计策了。","source_cn":"还在做追捕工作的时候，我以为我已经很了解那些勾心斗角的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB4D5653C1E3C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421443005:1":{"text":"但如今走到台前来，人们的算计，势力、阶级与信仰的关系，却让我觉得越来越复杂……","source_cn":"但如今走到台前来，人们的算计，势力、阶级与信仰的关系，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5D98FBBFF549CE9","va